ected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc" :question/answer-fields "cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3"] [:db/ensure "c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc"] [:db/add "2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f" :answer/id #uuid "2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f"] [:db/add "2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f" :answer/value "\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u"] [:db/ensure "2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7" :answer/id #uuid "f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7"] [:db/add "f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7" :answer/value "3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a" :answer/id #uuid "1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a"] [:db/add "1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a" :answer/value "-1\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1