|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|2 x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be" :question/answer-fields "a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404"] [:db/ensure "c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be"] [:db/add "21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3" :answer/id #uuid "21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3"] [:db/add "21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23" :answer/id #uuid "94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23"] [:db/add "94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23" :answer/validate] [:db/add "88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc" :answer/id #uuid "88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc"] [:db/add "88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\ri