tion/id #uuid "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4"] [:db/add "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4" :question/problem "Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{1}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4" :question/answer-fields "d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246"] [:db/ensure "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4"] [:db/add "8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b" :answer/id #uuid "8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b"] [:db/add "8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346" :answer/id #uuid "b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346"] [:db/add "b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "b1dd7846-263