nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936" :question/answer-fields "50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30"] [:db/ensure "42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936"] [:db/add "b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57" :answer/id #uuid "b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57"] [:db/add "b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f" :answer/id #uuid "8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f"] [:db/add "8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/