vative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b" :question/answer-fields "b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b"] [:db/ensure "f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b"] [:db/add "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9" :answer/id #uuid "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9"] [:db/add "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e" :answer/id #uuid "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e"] [:db/add "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right