\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa" :question/answer-fields "4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010"] [:db/ensure "f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa"] [:db/add "70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c" :answer/id #uuid "70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c"] [:db/add "70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c" :answer/id #uuid "fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c"] [:db/add "fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e" :answer/id #uuid "423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e"] [:db/add "423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d" :answer/id #uuid "6b5c2a