}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943" :question/answer-fields "13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96"] [:db/ensure "bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943"] [:db/add "7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511" :answer/id #uuid "7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511"] [:db/add "7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511" :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511" :answer/validate] [:db/add "876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5" :answer/id #uuid "876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5"] [:db/add "876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5" :answer/ty