$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $16\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=4$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735" :question/answer-fields "70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b"] [:db/ensure "062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735"] [:db/add "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77" :answer/id #uuid "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77"] [:db/add "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35" :answer/id #uuid "e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35"] [:db/add "e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35" :answer/t