/choices "41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441"] [:db/add "2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb" :answer-field/choices "98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171"] [:db/add "2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb" :answer-field/correct "752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77"] [:db/ensure "2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/id #uuid "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9"] [:db/add "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/answer-fields "2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb"] [:db/ensure "a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "a18b62e4-