$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61" :question/answer-fields "c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d"] [:db/ensure "b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61"] [:db/add "61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f" :answer/id #uuid "61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f"] [:db/add "61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f" :answer/value "4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5" :answer/id #uuid "61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5"] [:db/add "61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5" :answer/value "8\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4